<title>CHINA: STARLIGHT INT'L YEARLY NET JUMPS 159 PCT.</title>
<headline>STARLIGHT INT'L YEARLY NET JUMPS 159 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  9.2	 vs 3.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   1.5	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 7.99 gain vs 13.63 gain</p>
<p>    Net			   25.93     vs 10.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		    1,289.78  vs 1,340.85</p>
<p>    Company name		Starlight International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 September 15-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  October 6</p>
<p>NOTE - Starlight is an electronics manufacturer.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one-for-two shares held.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of interest in associated companies.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 2.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs one cent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
